{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":15,"voice":"en-GB-LibbyNeural","engine":"edge","duration":300.288,"segs":[{"b":0,"part":0,"text":"Creation is like a tree created by of Maya","start":0.0,"dur":3.984,"words":[[0.1,0.537,"Creation"],[0.775,0.212,"is"],[1.0,0.225,"like"],[1.275,0.05,"a"],[1.325,0.25,"tree"],[1.688,0.512,"created"],[2.25,0.15,"by"],[2.5,0.037,"of"],[2.587,0.338,"Maya"]]},{"b":1,"part":0,"text":"The Supreme Lord said: Sages speak of the eternal banyan tree that has its origin (or root) above in the Supreme Being and branches below in the cosmos, and whose leaves are the Vedic hymns. One who understands this tree is a knower of the Vedas. The branches of this cosmic tree of Maya (Illusion) spread all over the cosmos. The tree is nourished by three modes of material Nature; sense pleasures are its sprouts; and its roots of ego, attachment and desire stretch below in the human world, causing Karmic bondage.","start":3.984,"dur":36.192,"words":[[0.1,0.087,"The"],[0.2,0.5,"Supreme"],[0.75,0.225,"Lord"],[1.038,0.287,"said"],[1.712,0.725,"Sages"],[2.45,0.312,"speak"],[2.763,0.062,"of"],[2.837,0.1,"the"],[3.0,0.4,"eternal"],[3.4,0.35,"banyan"],[3.775,0.25,"tree"],[4.237,0.263,"that"],[4.525,0.138,"has"],[4.662,0.138,"its"],[4.825,0.487,"origin"],[5.675,0.212,"or"],[5.987,0.275,"root"],[6.713,0.275,"above"],[7.0,0.087,"in"],[7.1,0.113,"the"],[7.213,0.475,"Supreme"],[7.725,0.263,"Being"],[8.062,0.062,"and"],[8.162,0.475,"branches"],[8.688,0.3,"below"],[9.075,0.037,"in"],[9.125,0.1,"the"],[9.225,0.512,"cosmos"],[10.012,0.362,"and"],[10.4,0.15,"whose"],[10.575,0.3,"leaves"],[10.912,0.1,"are"],[11.062,0.075,"the"],[11.15,0.35,"Vedic"],[11.525,0.325,"hymns"],[13.1,0.237,"One"],[13.387,0.15,"who"],[13.6,0.713,"understands"],[14.35,0.15,"this"],[14.512,0.312,"tree"],[15.025,0.25,"is"],[15.275,0.1,"a"],[15.387,0.275,"knower"],[15.7,0.087,"of"],[15.8,0.113,"the"],[15.912,0.425,"Vedas"],[17.387,0.062,"The"],[17.462,0.475,"branches"],[17.95,0.113,"of"],[18.087,0.15,"this"],[18.25,0